/*
  ============================================================
              LIFELANE AI
        A1 / MASTER / AMBULANCE 1
  ============================================================

  ESP32 Arduino Core 2.0.17

  DEMO ROUTE:
    HOUSE 1 -> J1 -> J2 -> HOSPITAL 1
    5 KM

  ACCIDENT:
    J2 accident before J2 entry
    -> cancel J2
    -> reroute 10 KM via J3
    -> J3 -> HOSPITAL 2

  NORMAL:
    GREEN 60 seconds
    YELLOW 10 seconds
    repeat

  EMERGENCY PREPARATION:
    J1 = 15 seconds
    J2 = 25 seconds
    J3 = 15 seconds

  LCD:
    LCD1 SDA 26 / SCL 25
    LCD2 SDA 27 / SCL 33
    LCD3 SDA 32 / SCL 13
    Address = 0x27

  ESP-NOW CHANNEL:
    1
*/

